+## Termux / Android ARM64 Quickstart
+
+To install context-mode on Termux Android ARM64:
+
+```bash
+curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sasazemzulin058-debug/context-mode/main/install-android.sh | sh
+```
diff --git a/install-android.sh b/install-android.sh
new file mode 100755
index 0000000..a8d7976
--- /dev/null
+++ b/install-android.sh
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+#!/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/sh
+set -e
+
+echo "=== Installing context-mode for Termux/Android ARM64 ==="
+AGENT_NPM="${HOME}/.pi/agent/npm"
+mkdir -p "$AGENT_NPM"
+
+cd "$AGENT_NPM"
+npm install "https://github.com/sasazemzulin058-debug/context-mode.git#main" --force --legacy-peer-deps
+
+echo "✅ context-mode successfully installed"
